avings from previously executed restructuring programs and discretionary cost savings in the quarter associated with reduced travel, controlled hiring, professional services and other costs, and $3 million of savings from variable compensation on a year-over-year basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/msa-safety-incorporated-msa-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q1","e":"msa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"It's very much like the tariff issue that we had several years ago and where we were able to raise prices in order to mitigate the impact on the gross margin line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/msa-safety-incorporated-msa-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q1","e":"msa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We are very active at evaluating additional price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/msa-safety-incorporated-msa-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q1","e":"msa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We delivered $7 million to $8 million of savings from restructuring programs and discretionary cost savings associated with reduced travel, controlled hiring, professional services and other costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/msa-safety-incorporated-msa-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q1","e":"msa","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"Overall, I remain confident in our ability to deliver the cost savings we've committed to for 2021 across the income statement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/msa-safety-incorporated-msa-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q2","e":"msa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We've been successful with our price increases in the past, as you know, with what we had with some of the tariffs and the challenges we had back during the Trump administration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/msa-safety-inc-msa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q2","e":"msa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We have implemented an off-cycle price increase to respond to the inflation that we are seeing in the U.S. across electronic components, resins and other inputs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/msa-safety-inc-msa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q2","e":"msa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We've implemented off-cycle price increases, and we're looking at further price increases as we move forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/msa-safety-inc-msa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q2","e":"msa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"Bacharach transaction costs of about $2 million and the remainder being the Bristol base SG&A. Our cost savings from restructuring programs effectively offset discretionary costs coming back into the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/msa-safety-inc-msa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q2","e":"msa","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We invested $7 million in restructuring programs in the quarter, primarily in our International segment as we continue to execute on our margin expansion road map.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/msa-safety-inc-msa-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"We have implemented off-cycle price increases to offset inflation, we're seeing in electronic components, resins and other materials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/msa-safety-inc-msa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nish J. Vartanian","x":"We've implemented off-cycle price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/msa-safety-inc-msa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth D. Krause","x":"Adjusting for nonrecurring transaction costs and other restructuring matters, the effective tax rate was 24.7% in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/msa-safety-inc-msa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2021 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nish J. Vartanian","x":"And the beauty is as we've looked at this and gone down the path, there's actually some cost savings associated with that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/msa-safety-inc-msa-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MSA 2025 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steven Blanco","x":"Second, on the operational and commercial side, we continue to execute our tariff mitigation programs in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/msa-msa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MSA 2025 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Beck","x":"Gross margins reflect inflation, tariff and transactional FX increases, partly offset by price increases and productivity gains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/msa-msa-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MSA 2025 Q3","e":"msa","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Blanco","x":"I think, Ross, we did one targeted price increa